&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingWriteDownsOfInventoriesTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:MajorComponentsOfSellingGeneralAndAdministrativeExpensesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;※３　販売費及び一般管理費のうち主要な費目及び金額は、次のとおりであります。&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:30pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:450pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:150pt;min-width:150pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:150pt;min-width:150pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:150pt;min-width:150pt;"/&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:22.5pt;min-height:22.5pt;"&gt;
