&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;２．連結会計年度中に売却したその他有価証券&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;"&gt;　前連結会計年度（&lt;span&gt;2023年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:22.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;"&gt;　当連結会計年度（&lt;span&gt;2024年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:22.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesSecuritiesConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
