  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAssetsAndLiabilitiesIncurredFromTransactionsWithAffiliatedEntitiesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;※２  関係会社に対する資産及び負債&lt;/h4&gt;
